OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787015895
OL,3,CBritain's fastest home-selling
OL,4,Chotspots revealed by study
OL,6,FThe average time to sell a home is
OL,7,Fnearly seven times faster in some
OL,8,Fparts of Britain than others ` with
OL,9,Faround half of local authority areas
OL,10,Frecording longer times to sell than a
OL,11,Fyear earlier, according to a property
OL,12,Fwebsite.
OL,14,FWhile the average time to sell of 42
OL,15,Fdays has remained unchanged in the
OL,16,Fyear to July, this masks a widening
OL,17,Fgap between faster local markets and
OL,18,Fweaker areas, Zoopla said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787015895
OL,3,CBritain's fastest home-selling
OL,4,Chotspots revealed by study
OL,6,FThe website said around half (180 of
OL,7,Fthe 363) of the local authorities it
OL,8,Fanalysed had seen an increase in the
OL,9,Faverage number of days taken to sell a
OL,10,Fproperty in the past year.
OL,12,FIn Melton in the East Midlands, Zoopla
OL,13,Fsaid it took 76 days on average to
OL,14,Fsell the average home ` a 21-day
OL,15,Fincrease compared with July 2025.
OL,17,FIn Falkirk in Scotland, the average
OL,18,Fselling time is around seven times
OL,19,Ffaster at just 11 days ` one day less
OL,20,Ffor the area than a year earlier.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
