PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787015895
OL,3,CBritain's fastest home-selling
OL,4,Chotspots revealed by study
OL,6,FHigher average mortgage rates have led
OL,7,Fto a "wait and see" approach for more
OL,8,Fbuyers ` lengthening the time it takes
OL,9,Fto find a buyer across many regional
OL,10,Fand local housing markets, Zoopla said.
OL,12,FMany of the faster markets are in
OL,13,FScotland, and the website said the
OL,14,Fspeed reflects the Scottish sales
OL,15,Fmarket working differently to the rest
OL,16,Fof Britain, and homes generally being
OL,17,Frelatively affordable.
OL,26,@oD@FOUoD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
