OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787015895
OL,3,CBritain's fastest home-selling
OL,4,Chotspots revealed by study
OL,6,FHomes in Scotland are typically
OL,7,Fmarketed as "offers over" a price,
OL,8,Fwith homes having a valuation and home
OL,9,Fsurvey available, Zoopla added.
OL,11,FRichard Donnell, executive director at
OL,12,FZoopla, said: "While the national time
OL,13,Fto sell has barely moved, that
OL,14,Fstability is masking a real divide
OL,15,Fopening up between local markets.
OL,17,F"In areas like Melton in
OL,18,FLeicestershire, homes are taking
OL,19,Fnoticeably longer to sell than a year
OL,20,Fago, while markets just a short drive
OL,21,Faway are speeding up."
OL,26,@oD@MOUoD@YO]tD@OOUyD@AOU}D@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
