OL,3,CBritain's fastest home-selling
OL,4,Chotspots revealed by study
OL,6,FHe suggested: "If you're selling in a
OL,7,Fslower market, don't take a 'wait and
OL,8,Fsee' approach ` talk to a local agent
OL,9,Fwho knows what's happening street by
OL,10,Fstreet, and make sure your home is
OL,11,Fpriced right from day one."
OL,13,FZoopla's "time to sell" research
OL,14,Ftracked the period from homes being
OL,15,Ffirst listed on the market to estate
OL,16,Fagents reporting sales agreed. Some
OL,17,Flocal authorities were excluded from
OL,18,Fthe research due to small sample sizes.
