OL,3,CBritain's fastest home-selling
OL,4,Chotspots revealed by study
OL,6,FWhen it comes to regional hot spots,
OL,7,FBarnsley and Newcastle-under-Lyme are
OL,8,Famong the areas selling much faster
OL,9,Fthan last year according to the
OL,10,Fwebsite ` with Barnsley sellers seeing
OL,11,Fan average speed increase of 13 days,
OL,12,Fand those in Newcastle-under-Lyme
OL,13,Fseeing an average 11 day speed
OL,14,Fincrease.
OL,16,FHere are the fastest selling hotspots,
OL,17,Faccording to Zoopla, with the average
OL,18,Fnumber of days to sell a property. The
OL,19,Ffigures were taken in July 2026:
OL,21,F1. Falkirk, 11
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
